    "http://dbpedia.org/property/knownFor": 1,
    "http://dbpedia.org/ontology/knownFor": 1,
    "Clyde William Tombaugh (/\u02c8t\u0252mba\u028a/; February 4, 1906 \u2013 January 17, 1997) was an American astronomer. He discovered Pluto in 1930, the first object to be discovered in what would later be identified as the Kuiper belt. At the time of discovery, Pluto was considered a planet but was later reclassified as a dwarf planet. Tombaugh also discovered many asteroids. He also called for the serious scientific research of unidentified flying objects, or UFOs.": 1,
    "Discovery of Pluto": 1,
